{
  "schema": "ld-s10y-image/figure-spec@2",
  "id": "fig-116",
  "mode": "hybrid",
  "description": "Exercise567 motorboat follows a log raft down the same river in the same leftward direction. Preserve natural river scene, one motorboat and one raft with two people; deterministic two source leftward arrows. No extra dimensions, speed labels or solved catch-up positions added.",
  "source": {
    "image": {
      "path": "ssot-resources/soviet10year-textbooks/artifacts/5m/figures/fig-116.png",
      "sha256": "945d2d09ba56d1a1c9488e0c86b25bd090ab293fa0d406c643d5e765d60b434a"
    },
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "代数式$5ab$是5和变数$a$与$b$的积.数字因数5叫做代数式$5ab$的系数.$(-6.2)\\cdot x$的系数等于$-6.2$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "假如积中包括几个数字因数，那么求系数时，要把这几个数字因数连乘起来.例如，式$0.3a\\cdot(-7b)$的系数等于$-2.1$，因为$0.3a\\cdot(-7b)=-2.1ab$.$ab$的系数应看作是1，因为$ab=1\\cdot ab$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "$-1$乘以任意数$a$得$-a$：\n$(-1)\\cdot a=-a$(图115).例如，$(-1)\\cdot9=-9$，$(-1)\\cdot(-7.8)=7.8$.所以$-a$的系数是$-1$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "对于任意正数$a$和$b$，下列等式成立："
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "$(-a)\\cdot b=a\\cdot(-b)=-(ab)$"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "$(-a)\\cdot(-b)=ab$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "这些等式对于任意数$a$和$b$都成立.约定在写代数式$-(ab)$时，一般不用括号："
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "$-(ab)=-ab$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "例."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "text": "$(-6)\\cdot x=-6x$；\n$(3)\\cdot(-a)=-3a$；\n$8\\cdot(-2c)=-16c$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "555",
        "text": "求下列各积的系数：\n1) $8m\\cdot7$；\n2) $-4\\cdot(-12x)$；\n3) $-2p\\cdot(-1.4)$；\n4) $6c\\cdot(-7)$；\n5) $a\\cdot2.5b$；\n6) $0.8m\\cdot4x$；\n7) $-2.5m\\cdot(-3a)$；\n8) $-0.11x\\cdot(-2m)$；\n9) $-2.7ab\\cdot(-1)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "556",
        "text": "说出下列和的每个加数和加数的系数：\n1) $-8a+x-7a-x$；\n2) $m+2k-3k+4k$；\n3) $7.2ab-ab+ab+9.3ab$；\n4) $-pk+1.5pk-9pk+pk$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "557",
        "text": "化简：\n1) $-a\\cdot(-b)$；\n2) $-3m\\cdot(-8k)$；\n3) $5a\\cdot(-6b)$；\n4) $4\\cdot(-2x)\\cdot(-3y)$；\n5) $-5\\cdot(-3m)\\cdot2n$；\n6) $-6a\\cdot5k\\cdot(-10)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "558",
        "text": "去掉下列各式中的括号：\n1) $-5a\\cdot(-a)-4m$；\n2) $-6a+7\\cdot(-b)$；\n3) $-11\\cdot(-x)-5.3\\cdot(-k)$；\n4) $a\\cdot(-2.6)+10\\cdot(-b)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "559",
        "text": "把下列和改成积的形式：\n1) $m+m+m+m$；\n2) $-a-a-a-a-a-a$；\n3) $-3x-3x-3x-3x-3x$；\n4) $-xy-xy-xy-xy-xy$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "560",
        "text": "求下列各题所有整数的积：\n1) 从1到5；\n2) 从$-5$到$-1$；\n3) 从$-5$到5；\n4) 从$-45$到50."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "561",
        "text": "求下列各式的值：\n1) $(10.8-12)\\cdot(6.7-9)$；\n2) $(11.3-13)\\cdot(5.8-8)$；\n3) $(16.7-12):(21.5-24)$；\n4) $(18.6-14):(31.5-34)$；\n5) $-2.79:3.1+24.24:2.4$；\n6) $2.07:(-2.3)+13.13:1.3$；\n7) $(1-1.5\\cdot1.4)\\cdot(-2.8)$；\n8) $(1-1.3\\cdot1.6)\\cdot(-3.2)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "562",
        "text": "某项虚构的工厂统计中，工厂原计划1974年的劳动生产率比1970年提高25%，实际提高了39%.1974年的劳动生产率比原计划提高百分之几？劳动生产率多提高百分之几？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "563",
        "text": "解应用题：\n1) 二人乘摩托车从相距250公里的甲、乙两市同时出发，相向而行.两小时后还要行驶30公里才能相遇.第一人乘摩托车的速度比第二人快10公里/小时.分别求出二人乘摩托车的速度.\n2) 内燃机车从甲站发出2小时后，把行速加快12公里/小时，于发车后5小时到达终点乙站.如果从甲站到乙站的距离为261公里，那么内燃机车开始的行速为多少公里/小时？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "564",
        "text": "化简：\n1) $-a\\cdot(-7)$；\n2) $b\\cdot(-4m)$；\n3) $-3\\cdot(-ab)$；\n4) $-mn\\cdot(-5)$；\n5) $2a\\cdot(-3b)$；\n6) $-7b\\cdot(-7a)$."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "565",
        "text": "设：$m=2,-3.2,-10$，求式$-2m-2m-2m-2m$的值."
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "566",
        "text": "一台自动机床1小时制造300个零件.这台机床改装后，1小时能制造同样的零件375个.机床的生产能力提高了百分之几？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "567",
        "text": "一艘汽艇追赶木排(图116).现在它们之间的距离是35公里.木排的速度是3公里/小时，汽艇的速度为10公里/小时.当$t=3,5,-2,-4$时，$t$小时以后，木排和汽艇之间的距离多远？"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math5-c1-s4-n30",
        "exercise": "568",
        "text": "计算：\n1) $227.36:(865.6-20.8\\cdot40.5)\\cdot8.38+1.12$；\n2) $278.64:(22.74+9.66)\\cdot(937.7-30.6\\cdot30.5)$."
      }
    ],
